\n\nFINDINGS (non-blocking):\n1. SHOULD-CONSIDER (LOW): v2_file_path_decision fail-opens when hook-config tracker_remote names a nonexistent remote while other remotes exist (probe skipped -> Allowed). Fix: enumerate remotes; fail closed when ANY remote exists; only zero-remotes may Allowed. Live configs are safe (tracker_remote=origin, valid).\n2. NIT: G6 interim 'missing issues dir' state is not durable — a write path recreates the empty dir (create_dir_all); harmless because read_all_issue_files returns empty for both missing and empty dirs, and hydrate early-returns on empty files.\n3. NIT: no regression test for the 7c5b3e88 warn-and-continue or marker-write-on-skip (latter confirmed live organically).\n\nVerdict trending APPROVE with recorded findings. Next: bins suite completion, then --kind result on #125 (issue stays open).","created_at":"2026-08-08T00:30:15.898007494Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:W8rQwdKJUREaLtmAbdemI6rkSDw+Tvi/qCwUBEnKg1o","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg21041u1Lh4OF9CC79OSsqRwEyf6XClhy7V55d+LtcJQAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABARQ5M5LQ/WUeYwr7to+3La2ThVxgmxJ8Pu1xOHkTJ5JXpTl0u8rDmqZLbIM9YFcEpAUzx7+YQNwnq+muIKr8VDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:W8rQwdKJUREaLtmAbdemI6rkSDw+Tvi/qCwUBEnKg1o","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg21041u1Lh4OF9CC79OSsqRwEyf6XClhy7V55d+LtcJQAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHn8wXspcLIUkf9R69PxcS8+0IR2u3Dhez9msML0HQnwVAX+FC3mET1MEDvklPdUocyHjnoQX4OktyzcQzo8kQ4="}
